  "prefLabel": "Occ 401.04 Supportive tasks",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 401.04 \"Supportive tasks\" means tasks or treatment which facilitate the delivery of occupational therapy, are routine, and are easily learned by unlicensed persons.\n\nSource. #8896, eff 6-7-07; ss and renumbered by #10902, eff 7-29-15 (from Occ 401.07); ss by #14478, eff 3-13-26, EXPIRES: 3-13-36 (formerly Occ 401.08)",
